+triples (the user charlemagne, the host peg, and the domain
+dunes.aja.com; and, the user lester, no host, and any domain) and one
+netgroup (kamakiriad).</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-12">Finally, an example of the nisObject class:</t>
+      <artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt="" pn="section-appendix.a-13"><![CDATA[
